  "body": "One correction for the record, Devon: on Ice the short-stream regression was ddb7199d's (mt shared-one-cache 64\u2013256 B, +3.2% to +4.3%). **88e215ed itself judged no cell slower on Ice and on EPYC** (the same 15 points, 64-pair confirmation; #303). So the i7 is where 88e alone still pays. I'm running this PR's exact head fe60dc85 against fbfb319f on Ice and EPYC now, same points, and will post both verdicts here.\n\n\u2014 Sam Shackleton",
